    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="2cf8c0b2-06fb-5d3e-8537-45c7195239c6" activityNameId="a7cd2d62-db8c-5882-84d5-73df2e2d5c6a" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electricity, PV, at 3kWp slanted-roof, a-Si, lam., integrated</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electricity, PV, at 3kWp slanted-roof, a-Si, lam., integrated
Assumption for electricity production of photovoltaic plants with good performance. Average performance is lower while optimum performance would be higher.  Dataset can be used for comparison of energy technologies in Switzerland, but not for assessment of average production patterns. Yield data must be corrected for the installations used in other countries.;
Synonyms: Solarmodul, PV-module, amorphous silicon; 
UUID: 4f6e0607-392c-37aa-b17c-92ab5c43c2db
Infrastructure for 3kWp PV-plant. Water use for cleaning. Amount of solar energy transformed to electricity. Waste heat emission due to losses of electricity in the system.
Location: Use in CH.
Technology: Electricity production with grid-connected photovoltaic power plants mounted on buildings slanted roof. 922 kWh/kWp annual electricity output, 1117 kWh/m2 irradiation, 0.75 performance ratio, 6.5% module efficiency.
Time period: Calculation of yield based on production with a state of the art plant.
Production volume: In 2008 there were 3'875 PV-plants with an annual production of 33'400 MWh
Sampling: Statistical data for CH. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_4f6e0607-392c-37aa-b17c-92ab5c43c2db.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
